[TeaMates Sync Request]

Summarize your current work state. If you have no meaningful updates since the last sync, respond with: {"has_updates": false}

Otherwise respond ONLY with a JSON object in this exact format:

{
  "has_updates": true,
  "status": "active" | "blocked" | "complete",
  "summary": "2-3 sentence description of current work",
  "facts_changed": ["new findings that change project understanding"],
  "decisions_made": ["choices made since last sync"],
  "artifacts_produced": [
    { "name": "filename.ext", "description": "one line", "format": "md|csv|json|text" }
  ],
  "open_questions": ["things needing input from human or teammates"],
  "blockers": ["what you need from others to continue"]
}

